metaclasses/ - teaching demos (classic style)
============================================

These illustrate Python's metaclass hooks.  They date from the 1.5 era
but still run on 2.7.

For new AmigaPython code, prefer new-style classes::

  class C(object):
      ...

  Eiffel.py     Pre/post conditions via metaclass
  Enum.py       Enumeration types
  Meta.py       Generic metaclass helpers
  Simple.py     Minimal tracing metaclass
  Trace.py      Call tracing

  index.html / meta-vladimir.txt   Background reading

Synch.py (thread locks) was removed: this Amiga port is built without
threads (WITH_THREAD undefined).
